    <bpmn:process id="W_W507" name="W507. Customer Complaint Root Cause Analysis &amp; Systemic Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly complaint pattern analysis run; or systemic issue threshold breached (same root cause &gt;5 complaints in 30 days per store/category/SKU)
Frequency: Monthly analysis; ad-hoc systemic issue alerts
Volume: ~12 monthly analyses/year; ~15–20 systemic issue alerts/year
Owner: Customer Experience Manager
Participants: Category Manager, Store Operations Manager, Supply Chain Analyst, Vendor Manager
Source: workflow W507 — Customer Complaint Root Cause Analysis &amp; Systemic Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
