    <bpmn:process id="W_W781" name="W781. Customer Store Credit Issuance &amp; Lifecycle Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer returns item without receipt; or customer elects store credit instead of refund; or service recovery per W660
Frequency: Daily; ~20 store credit issuances per day chain-wide (~600/month per the Volume)
Volume: 200 stores × ~3 issuances/store/month = ~600 issuances/month (~PHP 2-4M outstanding at any time)
Owner: Customer Service Rep
Participants: CSR, Customer, Store Manager, AR Accountant
Source: workflow W781 — Customer Store Credit Issuance &amp; Lifecycle Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W781_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W781_Lane1" name="CSR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W781_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W781_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W781_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W781_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W781_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W781_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W781_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W781_Lane3" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W781_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W781_Lane4" name="AR Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W781_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W781_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W781_Start6" name="Customer returns item without receipt; or customer elects store credit instead of refund…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W781_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W781_Task7" name="Store credit issuance trigger">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Store credit issuance trigger: CSR identifies issuance scenario: (a) return without receipt — store credit is default option per W12A, (b) customer preference — customer chooses store credit over refund per W101, (c) service recovery — Store Manager authorizes store credit per W660 tiered authorization
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): Store Manager (&gt; PHP 5,000)
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W781_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W781_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W781_Task8" name="Credit amount determination">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Credit amount determination: CSR determines store credit value: (a) with receipt: full purchase price including VAT, (b) without receipt: current selling price (system checks POS price master per W289), (c) damaged/open-box: assessed value per W549 condition classification, (d) service recovery: amount per W660 authorization tier
Responsible (R): CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W781_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W781_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W781_Task9" name="Store credit issuance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Store credit issuance: System generates store credit: (a) unique barcode/QR code, (b) credit amount with PHP value, (c) issuance date and expiry (12 months), (d) issuing store reference, (e) CSR and Store Manager ID, (f) customer name and phone (if provided — not required for issuance), (g) prints physical store credit slip and/or sends digital version via SMS
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): CSR
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W781_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W781_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W781_Task10" name="Accounting entry">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Accounting entry: System records: (a) DR Customer Refund Expense / CR Store Credit Liability (not revenue until redeemed), (b) if return: also reverses COGS and restores inventory per W12, (c) if service recovery: DR Customer Recovery Expense / CR Store Credit Liability
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W781_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W781_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W781_Task11" name="Customer communication">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Customer communication: Customer receives: (a) physical store credit slip with barcode, amount, and expiry, (b) digital store credit via SMS/email if contact provided, (c) reminder: &quot;This store credit expires on [date]. Use at any BuildRight Depot store.&quot;
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W781_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W781_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W781_Task12" name="Store credit redemption">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Store credit redemption: At checkout (W5B): (a) cashier scans store credit barcode/QR, (b) system validates: active, not expired, amount available, (c) applies as tender type &quot;Store Credit&quot;, (d) partial redemption allowed — remaining balance issued as new store credit slip, (e) system posts: DR Store Credit Liability / CR Sales Revenue per PFRS 15
Responsible (R): Cashier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W781_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W781_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W781_Task13" name="Monthly store credit reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Monthly store credit reconciliation: AR Accountant reconciles: (a) total store credit issued vs. redeemed vs. outstanding, (b) expiry schedule (credits approaching 12-month expiry), (c) store credit liability balance on balance sheet, (d) redemption rate (target: &gt; 80% within 6 months), (e) expired credit breakage recognition per PFRS 15 per FIN-039
Responsible (R): AR Accountant
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W781_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W781_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W781_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W781_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W781_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-278 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Support &amp; Complaints (PA-13.1).) | - operational: validation mitigate
Owner: Customer Service Rep</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W781_Assoc16" sourceRef="W781_Annotation15" targetRef="W781_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W781_Flow17" sourceRef="W781_Start6" targetRef="W781_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W781_Flow18" sourceRef="W781_Task7" targetRef="W781_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W781_Flow19" sourceRef="W781_Task8" targetRef="W781_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W781_Flow20" sourceRef="W781_Task9" targetRef="W781_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W781_Flow21" sourceRef="W781_Task10" targetRef="W781_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W781_Flow22" sourceRef="W781_Task11" targetRef="W781_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W781_Flow23" sourceRef="W781_Task12" targetRef="W781_Task13" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W781_Flow24" sourceRef="W781_Task13" targetRef="W781_End14" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W781_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W781_plane" bpmnElement="W_W781">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W781_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W781_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1790" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
