    <bpmn:process id="W_W820" name="W820. Customer Project BOM Estimation &amp; Material Planning Service" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer (B2C or B2B trade) requests project material estimation and planning assistance
Frequency: Daily; ~200–300 project estimation requests per month across all stores
Volume: ~200–300/month; 60% B2C (homeowners with renovation plans), 30% trade professionals, 10% corporate/institutional; average project value PHP 30K-500K
Owner: Sales Associate / Trade Counter Specialist
Participants: Sales Associate, Department Supervisor, Trade Account Manager (for B2B), Customer, Merchandising Planner
Source: workflow W820 — Customer Project BOM Estimation &amp; Material Planning Service</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W820_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W820_Lane1" name="Customer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W820_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W820_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W820_Lane2" name="Sales Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W820_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W820_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W820_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W820_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W820_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W820_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W820_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W820_Lane4" name="Trade Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W820_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W820_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W820_Start6" name="Customer (B2C or B2B trade) requests project material estimation and planning assistance">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W820_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W820_Task7" name="Customer describes project">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer describes project to Sales Associate or Trade Counter Specialist: project type, dimensions/scope, budget range, quality tier, timeline
Responsible (R): Customer / Sales Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5-10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W820_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W820_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W820_Task8" name="Sales Associate enters project parameters">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Associate enters project parameters into BOM estimation tool integrated with ERP: (a) project type template (bathroom renovation, kitchen build, fencing, decking, electrical wiring, plumbing system, room addition), (b) dimensions (area, perimeter, ceiling height), (c) quality tier (economy/standard/premium)
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5-10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W820_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W820_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W820_Task9" name="System generates BOM">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System generates BOM: (a) calculates quantities by item using project templates × dimensions × wastage factors (tiles: +10% wastage, paint: coverage per gallon × coats × area, lumber: linear feet by member spacing, cement: bags per cubic meter), (b) includes all ancillary materials (adhesives, fasteners, sealants, tools needed), (c) selects items from active assortment per W252 item master, (d) applies customer&#x27;s price tier (retail/trade/corporate per pricing master W289)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Sales Associate
Duration: 1-2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W820_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W820_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W820_Task10" name="Sales Associate reviews system-generated BOM with customer">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Sales Associate reviews system-generated BOM with customer: (a) walks through each line item explaining purpose, (b) suggests alternatives per W279 substitution rules where customer budget is constrained, (c) identifies items currently on promotion per W13, (d) confirms quantities against project scope
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): Customer
Duration: 10-20 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W820_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W820_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W820_Task11" name="Customer approves BOM">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Customer approves BOM: system creates project quotation per W542 with line items, quantities, prices, project reference number
Responsible (R): Sales Associate / Customer
Accountable (A): Department Supervisor
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W820_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W820_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W820_Task12" name="Optional: Customer converts quotation to order">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Optional: Customer converts quotation to order — (a) B2C: creates special order per W545 with scheduled pickup/delivery per W5D, (b) B2B trade: creates project order per W162 with staged delivery per W164
Responsible (R): Sales Associate / Trade Account Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10-15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W820_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W820_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W820_Task13" name="For B2B projects">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: For B2B projects: Trade Account Manager schedules project material staging — coordinates with W4 replenishment for items not in stock, W57 promo stock allocation for promotional items
Responsible (R): Trade Account Manager
Accountable (A): Merchandising Planner
Duration: 15-30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W820_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W820_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W820_Task14" name="Post-project">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Post-project: Sales Associate follows up for customer satisfaction per W756 and identifies additional sales opportunities
Responsible (R): Sales Associate
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5-10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W820_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W820_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W820_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W820_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W820_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-278 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Support &amp; Complaints (PA-13.1).) | - operational: templates may not cover custom designs — non-standard projects require manual BOM creation
Owner: Sales Associate / Trade Counter Specialist</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
