    <bpmn:process id="W_W821" name="W821. Customer Project Warranty Registration &amp; Multi-Year Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer completes a project purchase (installed service per W138 or self-managed BOM per W820) above PHP 50K threshold
Frequency: Weekly; ~300–500 project warranty registrations per month
Volume: ~300–500 registrations/month; average warranty period 1-5 years; active warranty portfolio of ~15,000–30,000 projects
Owner: Customer Service Manager
Participants: CSR, Service Installation Manager, Customer, Vendor (for vendor warranty claims)
Source: workflow W821 — Customer Project Warranty Registration &amp; Multi-Year Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W821_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W821_Lane1" name="Sales Associate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W821_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W821_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W821_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W821_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W821_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W821_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W821_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W821_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W821_Lane3" name="CSR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W821_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W821_Lane4" name="Customer Service Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W821_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W821_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W821_Start6" name="Customer completes a project purchase (installed service per W138 or self-managed BOM per…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W821_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W821_Task7" name="At project completion">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: At project completion: Sales Associate or Service Installation Manager initiates warranty registration for qualifying purchases (a) above PHP 50K or (b) any installed service per W138
Responsible (R): Sales Associate / Service Installation Mgr
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W821_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W821_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W821_Task8" name="System creates warranty record">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System creates warranty record: (a) customer account link, (b) project reference (quotation/order number), (c) covered items with serial numbers per W8 serial tracking, (d) warranty terms by item (vendor warranty period, BuildRight extended warranty if offered, coverage scope), (e) installation date = warranty start date for installed services, (f) photos of completed installation uploaded per W255 document storage
Responsible (R): System / CSR
Accountable (A): Customer Service Manager
Duration: 5-10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W821_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W821_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W821_Task9" name="System calculates warranty liability per PFRS 15">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System calculates warranty liability per PFRS 15 per W487: estimated warranty cost as % of project revenue, accrual posted to GL
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W821_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W821_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W821_Task10" name="Customer receives warranty certificate">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Customer receives warranty certificate via W708 communication management: (a) coverage summary, (b) claim process instructions, (c) maintenance recommendations to preserve warranty, (d) customer portal link for warranty status
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W821_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W821_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W821_Task11" name="During warranty period">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: During warranty period: system tracks — (a) warranty expiration dates, (b) 60/30-day pre-expiration notifications to customer per W708, (c) maintenance reminders (e.g., annual water heater inspection), (d) warranty claim history per W33
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W821_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W821_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W821_Task12" name="At warranty claim per W33">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: At warranty claim per W33: system validates — (a) warranty status (active/expired), (b) coverage scope (does issue fall under warranty?), (c) customer&#x27;s maintenance compliance, (d) vendor warranty vs. BuildRight warranty responsibility
Responsible (R): System / CSR
Accountable (A): Customer Service Manager
Duration: 5-10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W821_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W821_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W821_Task13" name="Vendor warranty recovery">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Vendor warranty recovery: for vendor-defective items, initiate vendor claim per W88 RTV or W110 CAPA with vendor cost recovery
Responsible (R): CSR / Procurement Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 15-30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W821_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W821_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W821_Task14" name="Annual warranty portfolio review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Annual warranty portfolio review: (a) warranty liability adequacy per PFRS 15, (b) claim rate by product category and vendor, (c) cost of warranty program vs. revenue uplift from warranty offering, (d) top warranty issue root causes feed into W507 systemic improvement
Responsible (R): Customer Service Manager
Accountable (A): Finance Manager / CFO
Duration: 8-10 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W821_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W821_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W821_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W821_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W821_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-278 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Support &amp; Complaints (PA-13.1).) | - operational: reliability over extended periods; operational: validation controls mitigate but edge cases exist
Owner: Customer Service Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W821_Assoc17" sourceRef="W821_Annotation16" targetRef="W821_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
