    <bpmn:process id="W_W936" name="W936. Customer B2B Self-Service Portal Order Management &amp; Account Access" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Trade or corporate account customer accesses the BuildRight B2B portal (b2b.buildright.com.ph) to place orders, view account status, or manage account information
Frequency: ~2,000–3,000 portal sessions/month; ~5,200 active trade accounts + 200 corporate accounts
Volume: ~800–1,200 orders placed via portal/month; average order value PHP 15,000–25,000
Owner: B2B Portal Administrator (IT) / Sales Rep (account management)
Participants: Trade/Corporate Customer, B2B Portal Administrator, Sales Rep, AR Supervisor, IT Support
Source: workflow W936 — Customer B2B Self-Service Portal Order Management &amp; Account Access</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W936_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W936_Lane1" name="Customer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task18</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W936_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W936_Lane3" name="IT Support">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task19</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W936_Lane4" name="Sales Rep">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W936_Lane5" name="B2B Portal Admin">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_Task21</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W936_End22</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W936_Start7" name="Trade or corporate account customer accesses the BuildRight B2B portal…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W936_Task8" name="Customer navigates to b2b.buildright.com.ph and logs in with registered email…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer navigates to b2b.buildright.com.ph and logs in with registered email and password (two-factor authentication via SMS OTP); first-time users activate account via email invitation from Sales Rep linked to their trade/corporate account (W24)
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W936_Task9" name="Portal displays personalized dashboard: account summary (credit limit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Portal displays personalized dashboard: account summary (credit limit, available credit, outstanding AR), recent orders, favorite/reorder lists, promotional offers applicable to their pricing tier, and assigned Sales Rep contact
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W936_Task10" name="Customer browses product catalog with trade-specific pricing displayed (trade…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Customer browses product catalog with trade-specific pricing displayed (trade price tier per CRM-003); searches by keyword, category, or SKU; views real-time inventory availability at their default store/DC; filters by in-stock only, brand, or specification
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5–10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W936_Task11" name="Customer adds items to cart with quantity entry; system validates quantity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Customer adds items to cart with quantity entry; system validates quantity against available ATP at serving location and applies quantity break pricing (POS-010) automatically; displays per-line margin savings vs. SRP for transparency
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W936_Task12" name="Customer proceeds to checkout: selects delivery option (pickup at designated…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Customer proceeds to checkout: selects delivery option (pickup at designated store, scheduled delivery from DC, or project site delivery per W5D); selects delivery date from available calendar slots; system calculates delivery fee by zone; confirms order total including VAT
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 3 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow29</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow30</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W936_Task13" name="System validates order against customer credit limit: available credit = credit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: System validates order against customer credit limit: available credit = credit limit − outstanding AR − open order commitments; if order exceeds available credit, system blocks checkout and displays message to contact Sales Rep for credit limit review (W328); if within limit, system creates Sales Order with project reference (if applicable per W58)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow30</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow31</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W936_Task14" name="Customer receives order confirmation via email with Sales Order number…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Customer receives order confirmation via email with Sales Order number, expected delivery/pickup date, and order summary; Sales Rep receives copy of order notification
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow31</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow32</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W936_Task15" name="Customer tracks order status through portal: Confirmed → Processing → Ready for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Customer tracks order status through portal: Confirmed → Processing → Ready for Pickup / Shipped → Delivered / Picked Up → Invoiced; real-time status from ERP order management (W536)
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: On demand</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow32</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow33</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W936_Task16" name="Customer downloads invoices and statements from portal: BIR-compliant sales…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Customer downloads invoices and statements from portal: BIR-compliant sales invoices (per DOC-002), account statements (per W892), and credit notes (per POS-052); 10-year document archive accessible per NFR-006
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: On demand</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow33</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow34</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W936_Task17" name="Customer manages account information: update contact person, delivery address…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: Customer manages account information: update contact person, delivery address, billing email; request credit limit increase (triggers W328 workflow); view payment history and outstanding balance
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): Sales Rep
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow34</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow35</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W936_Task18" name="Customer creates and manages reorder lists (favorites): save frequently ordered…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 11: Customer creates and manages reorder lists (favorites): save frequently ordered item lists for one-click reorder; share lists with team members within same corporate account
Responsible (R): Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min/creation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow35</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow36</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W936_Task19" name="IT Support monitors portal health: uptime, page load time, error rates, login…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 12: IT Support monitors portal health: uptime, page load time, error rates, login success rate, order submission success rate; weekly analytics dashboard with adoption metrics (active users, order volume, feature utilization)
Responsible (R): IT Support
Accountable (A): B2B Portal Admin
Duration: 2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow36</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow37</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W936_Task20" name="Monthly: Sales Rep reviews portal adoption for assigned accounts; contacts…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 13: Monthly: Sales Rep reviews portal adoption for assigned accounts; contacts non-adopting trade accounts to offer portal training and onboarding; reports portal feedback and enhancement requests to IT per W616
Responsible (R): Sales Rep
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: 1 hour/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow37</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow38</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W936_Task21" name="Quarterly: B2B Portal Administrator reviews portal analytics — order volume…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 14: Quarterly: B2B Portal Administrator reviews portal analytics — order volume trend, average order value (portal vs. phone/email), customer satisfaction (NPS from portal), feature request backlog, and competitive benchmarking; presents to Head of Trade / Account Management and CIO
Responsible (R): B2B Portal Admin
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management / CIO
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow38</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W936_Flow39</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W936_End22" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W936_Flow39</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W936_Annotation23">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-278 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Support &amp; Complaints (PA-13.1).) | - operational: B2B Portal Administrator (IT) / Sales Rep (account management) review and approval gate
Owner: B2B Portal Administrator (IT) / Sales Rep (account management)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W936_Assoc24" sourceRef="W936_Annotation23" targetRef="W936_Start7" associationDirection="None" />
