    <bpmn:process id="W_W1229" name="W1229. Customer Power Tool &amp; Appliance Product Registration &amp; Extended Warranty Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer purchases a power tool or appliance and completes product registration (in-store at POS, online via ecommerce, or post-purchase via web/app)
Frequency: ~8,000–12,000 product registrations/month (power tools + appliances represent ~10% of active SKUs)
Volume: ~10,000 registrations/month; ~120,000/year
Owner: Customer Service Team Lead
Participants: Customer Service Representative, Customer, Vendor Warranty Coordinator
Source: workflow W1229 — Customer Power Tool &amp; Appliance Product Registration &amp; Extended Warranty Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1229_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1229_Lane1" name="CSR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1229_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1229_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1229_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1229_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1229_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1229_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1229_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1229_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1229_Lane3" name="Customer Service Team Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1229_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1229_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1229_Start5" name="Customer purchases a power tool or appliance and completes product registration (in-store…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1229_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1229_Task6" name="Registration data capture">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Registration data capture: Customer provides: (a) product SKU/serial number (scanned at POS or entered online); (b) purchase date and receipt number (auto-populated from POS transaction or manual entry online); (c) customer name, contact number, email, and address; (d) optional: loyalty card number for auto-fill per W17
Responsible (R): CSR / Customer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 3–5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1229_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1229_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1229_Task7" name="System registration">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System registration: System creates product registration record: (a) link to customer master (existing or new); (b) link to transaction/receipt; (c) capture serial number for serial-tracked items; (d) determine warranty eligibility (confirm item qualifies for warranty — not used/refurbished); (e) set warranty start date = purchase date; (f) set warranty end date per manufacturer warranty period
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1229_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1229_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1229_Task8" name="Extended warranty offer">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Extended warranty offer: If customer did not purchase extended warranty at POS: (a) system triggers extended warranty offer (email/SMS) within 7 days of purchase; (b) offer includes pricing and coverage details; (c) customer can purchase online; (d) if purchased: extend warranty end date in registration record; (e) revenue recognized for extended warranty as deferred revenue (service liability)
Responsible (R): System / Customer
Accountable (A): Customer Service Team Lead
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1229_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1229_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1229_Task9" name="Vendor registration transmission">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Vendor registration transmission: For vendors requiring direct registration: (a) system transmits registration data to vendor via API or batch file per vendor agreement; (b) vendor confirms registration; (c) BuildRight stores vendor confirmation reference
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1229_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1229_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1229_Task10" name="Warranty claim linkage">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Warranty claim linkage: When customer files warranty claim per W33: (a) system auto-retrieves product registration by serial number or receipt; (b) verify warranty status (active/expired); (c) determine coverage (manufacturer warranty, extended warranty, or out-of-warranty); (d) process claim accordingly
Responsible (R): System / CSR
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Per W33</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1229_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1229_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1229_Task11" name="Recall notification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Recall notification: When product recall issued per W29: (a) system identifies all registered owners of recalled product; (b) auto-generate notification (email, SMS, in-app) to registered customers; (c) track notification delivery and customer response
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Customer Service Team Lead
Duration: Per W29</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1229_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1229_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1229_Task12" name="Registration analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Registration analytics: Monthly: (a) registration rate (% of eligible products registered); (b) extended warranty attachment rate; (c) registration channel distribution (POS, online, app); (d) vendor registration confirmation rate
Responsible (R): Customer Service Team Lead
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1229_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1229_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1229_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1229_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1229_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-278 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Support &amp; Complaints (PA-13.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Customer Service Team Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1229_Assoc15" sourceRef="W1229_Annotation14" targetRef="W1229_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
