    <bpmn:process id="W_W1240" name="W1240. Customer Project Completion Follow-Up, Satisfaction Survey &amp; Cross-Sell Opportunity" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: B2B trade or corporate project order marked as fully delivered and invoiced
Frequency: ~5–8 B2B project completions/month (~65–100/year, per the canon)
Volume: ~5,200 active trade/corporate accounts; ~600 projects completing/month
Owner: B2B Account Manager
Participants: B2B Account Manager, Customer (Contractor/Developer/Institution), Category Manager
Source: workflow W1240 — Customer Project Completion Follow-Up, Satisfaction Survey &amp; Cross-Sell Opportunity</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1240_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1240_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1240_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1240_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1240_Lane2" name="B2B Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1240_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1240_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1240_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1240_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1240_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1240_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1240_Start4" name="B2B trade or corporate project order marked as fully delivered and invoiced">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1240_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1240_Task5" name="Project completion identification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Project completion identification: System flags B2B project as completed when: (a) all staged deliveries received per W164; (b) final invoice issued per W165; (c) retention amount (if any) released per milestone schedule; (d) no open disputes or backorders
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1240_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1240_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1240_Task6" name="Customer follow-up call">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Customer follow-up call: B2B Account Manager contacts customer within 5 business days: (a) confirm all materials received satisfactorily; (b) ask about any quality issues (lumber grading per W1243, tile breakage, appliance defects); (c) ask about delivery timeliness and completeness; (d) ask if any items were returned or exchanged; (e) record feedback in CRM
Responsible (R): B2B Account Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15–20 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1240_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1240_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1240_Task7" name="Satisfaction survey">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Satisfaction survey: B2B Account Manager conducts brief survey: (a) overall satisfaction rating (1–10); (b) likelihood to recommend BuildRight for future projects (NPS); (c) satisfaction by dimension: product quality, pricing, delivery, account management; (d) open-ended improvement suggestions
Responsible (R): B2B Account Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1240_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1240_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1240_Task8" name="Issue resolution (if any)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Issue resolution (if any): If customer reports issues: (a) log issue in complaint management system per W41; (b) B2B Account Manager coordinates resolution with relevant teams (supply chain, vendor, finance); (c) track resolution to closure; (d) confirm with customer that issue is resolved
Responsible (R): B2B Account Manager
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Varies</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1240_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1240_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1240_Task9" name="Next project identification &amp; cross-sell">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Next project identification &amp; cross-sell: (a) ask about upcoming projects; (b) if customer has new project: discuss material requirements and timeline; (c) offer to prepare project quotation per W162; (d) suggest relevant products/categories (e.g., &quot;you bought structural materials from us, we also supply tiles and fixtures — here&#x27;s our catalog&quot;); (e) update customer pipeline in CRM per W103
Responsible (R): B2B Account Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10–15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1240_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1240_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1240_Task10" name="CRM update &amp; reporting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: CRM update &amp; reporting: (a) update customer record in CRM with survey results, project feedback, and next project pipeline; (b) flag dissatisfied customers (score ≤6) for management attention; (c) generate monthly project completion and satisfaction summary for Head of Trade / Account Management; (d) feed satisfaction data into W65 CSAT/NPS measurement
Responsible (R): B2B Account Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1240_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1240_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1240_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1240_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1240_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-278 (ensure controlled execution — Customer Support &amp; Complaints (PA-13.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: B2B Account Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1240_Assoc13" sourceRef="W1240_Annotation12" targetRef="W1240_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1240_Flow14" sourceRef="W1240_Start4" targetRef="W1240_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1240_Flow15" sourceRef="W1240_Task5" targetRef="W1240_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1240_Flow16" sourceRef="W1240_Task6" targetRef="W1240_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1240_Flow17" sourceRef="W1240_Task7" targetRef="W1240_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1240_Flow18" sourceRef="W1240_Task8" targetRef="W1240_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1240_Flow19" sourceRef="W1240_Task9" targetRef="W1240_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W1240_Flow20" sourceRef="W1240_Task10" targetRef="W1240_End11" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W1240_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W1240_plane" bpmnElement="W_W1240">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1240_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W1240_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1580" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W1240_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W1240_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="1580" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
